Package: libzxkit-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zlib1g-dev
Description: ZX Spectrum emulation library development files
 C++23 library for emulating Z80-based Spectrum machines. Includes static
 libraries, public headers, CMake package files and the bundled SafeCpp headers.

Package: zxkit-tools
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ZX Spectrum tools
 Utilities for inspecting and manipulating ZX Spectrum media, and an MCP
 server for headless emulation and reverse engineering.

Package: zxkit-mc
Section: utils
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zxkit-tools (>= ${source:Version}), mc (>= 3:4.8.29)
Replaces: zxkit-tools (<< 1.0.0-2)
Enhances: mc
Description: Midnight Commander support for ZX Spectrum media
 An extfs helper that lets Midnight Commander open ZX Spectrum tape, disk and
 Microdrive images as directories and copy, edit and delete the files inside
 them, using the zxmedia tool.
 .
 The helper is installed in Midnight Commander's own extfs directory, so
 "cd games.tap/zxkit://" works at once. The zxkit-mc-setup command adds the
 file associations (Enter opens an image, F3 lists it) to a user's
 mc.ext.ini, which requires Midnight Commander 4.8.29 or later.
